[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3121.03, "timestamp": "00:52:01", "text": "不要保存。 好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3123.19, "timestamp": "00:52:03", "text": "为什么 YouTube"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3125.51, "timestamp": "00:52:05", "text": "从显示用户名改为显示"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3128.87, "timestamp": "00:52:08", "text": "广告？ 哦，我觉得这像是一种新事物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3132.71, "timestamp": "00:52:12", "text": "呃，因为他们引入了用户名功能，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3135.43, "timestamp": "00:52:15", "text": "呃，当他们引入用户名"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3137.43, "timestamp": "00:52:17", "text": "功能时，他们就把评论功能放在了优先位置"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3140.39, "timestamp": "00:52:20", "text": "，对吧？ 然后他们改变了，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3145.27, "timestamp": "00:52:25", "text": "让直播也受到了影响"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3148.87, "timestamp": "00:52:28", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3152.15, "timestamp": "00:52:32", "text": "但是，浏览器有一个扩展程序，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3161.589, "timestamp": "00:52:41", "text": "它可以显示你的显示名称，而不是用户名。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3164.79, "timestamp": "00:52:44", "text": "我忘了那个扩展程序的名字。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3166.79, "timestamp": "00:52:46", "text": "但是有一个扩展程序可以做到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3170.79, "timestamp": "00:52:50", "text": "这一点。 如果你想的话，你也可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3173.91, "timestamp": "00:52:53", "text": "那样做。"}]